<title>SINGAPORE: IPCO says in US$3.9 million legal dispute.</title>
<headline>IPCO says in US$3.9 million legal dispute.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPCO International Ltd said on Monday it is contesting a demand for payment of US$3.9 million.</p>
<p>Construction group IPCO said HSBC Capital (Asia) Pte Ltd was asking for the amount pursuant to a banker's guarantee issued in its favour at the request of an IPCO subsidiary, related to an equipment lease.</p>
<p>IPCO said it had begun a court action to determine whether the lease and guarantee are enforceable by HSBC capital, and meantime obtained an interim injunction against HSBC from demanding or collecting payment.</p>
